The mpchess piece set
=====================

The twelve SVG files in this directory (wK, wQ, wR, wB, wN, wP, bK, bQ, bR,
bB, bN, bP) are the "mpchess" chess piece set drawn by Maxime Chupin for his
MPchess MetaPost package. They are copied unchanged from the piece set's own
repository, directory svg/, at commit 720f6e050b4ee9b6e68f1ef5d89330a44850d54e
(2023-05-09):

    https://github.com/chupinmaxime/mpchess-pieces
    (mirror of https://plmlab.math.cnrs.fr/mchupin/mpchess-pieces)

Author:   Maxime Chupin
Licence:  GNU General Public License, version 3 (the repository's LICENSE file
          and README state "GNU GENERAL PUBLIC LICENSE, Version 3, 29 June
          2007"; Lichess, which ships the same set, records it as GPL-3.0 or
          later in its COPYING.md). The full text of the licence is in the
          LICENSE file at the root of the Force Chess repository and at
          https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt.

Note on provenance: the MPchess package on CTAN (https://ctan.org/pkg/mpchess)
is itself under the LaTeX Project Public License 1.3c, with its cburnett piece
file under GPL-2.0-or-later. The piece set used here is not taken from that
package; it is the separately published set above, which carries its own GPL-3
licence. The verification was done against the CTAN package page, the package
README in the CTAN archive, and the mpchess-pieces repository on 2026-11-09.

Force Chess is itself distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later, so the set is
distributed under the same terms as the rest of the site.
